+  <desc id="architecture-desc">An ExperimentSpec compiles into a DAG, controlled cells, jobs, and attempts. Attempts emit append-only ledger events. Measurement rules turn those events into information before a dependency gate permits policy. Policy becomes an experiment arm in a grid and campaign, outcomes are compared, and adaptation changes one variable in the next specification. The diagram also maps the machine to Why, How, What, cost levers, reversible and compounding doors, and the N by M evidence burden.</desc>
